常侍段珪等，劫帝走小平津〖4〗；卓遂将其众迎帝于北芒〖5〗，还宫。﹝二﹞时进弟车骑将军苗，为进众所杀〖6〗。﹝三﹞进、苗部曲无所属〖7〗，皆诣卓；卓又使吕布杀执金吾丁原〖8〗，并其众：故京都兵权唯在卓。﹝四﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o032","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ebfd66c9c853e0cbb822","layer":"original","quote":"中常侍段珪等，矫太后命，召进入议，遂杀之。宫中乱。﹝四﹞术将虎贲烧南宫嘉德殿青琐门〖12〗，欲以迫出珪等。珪等不出，劫帝及帝弟陈留王，走小平津。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o033","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-7f9d355b395577aab159","layer":"original","quote":"绍既斩宦者所署司隶校尉〔樊陵、河南尹〕许相〖13〗；遂勒兵捕诸阉人，无少长皆杀之；或有无须而误死者；至自发露形体而后得免。宦者或有行善自守而犹见及〖14〗，其滥如此，死者二千余人。急追珪等，珪等悉赴河死。帝得还宫。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
